{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03569","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 李峤","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑞塔千寻起，仙舆九日来。\n萸房陈宝席，菊橤散花台。\n御气鹏霄近，升高凤野开。\n天歌将梵乐，空里共裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}